flowchart TD
    A[format modelName, tag, msg] --> B[getInfoTag]
    B --> C[当前时间]
    C --> D[拼 modelName / tag]
    D --> E[Thread.stackTrace]
    E --> F{类名是 com.haha.log.* 或含 DOFLogUtil?}
    F -->|是| E
    F -->|否| G[取 fileName / method / line]
    G --> H[拼进程名 + 线程名]
    H --> I["前缀 + : + msg"]
